<section class="dossier-section" aria-labelledby="business-timing-title">
    <div class="dossier-wrap timing-grid">
        <div>
            <p class="dossier-eyebrow"><span>03</span> Timing</p>
            <h2 id="business-timing-title">Do not negotiate from a position you have never examined.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="timing-copy">
            <p>Changing one password or removing one visible permission rarely resolves the whole path. Acting without the full picture can lock you out, disrupt legitimate business access or leave the consequential exposure untouched.</p>
            <p>The responsible sequence is to understand your own environment, contain anything urgent and then harden it methodically.</p>
